Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:06.64,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}對輕咬示好的小貓們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:12.46,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我們由此相視而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:18.63,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我們永遠如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:21.66,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}該是多麼平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:24.18,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是愛意襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:27.95,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越發急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:30.80,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:31.30,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:34.06,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就選你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:36.81,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:37.10,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:39.78,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:42.32,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:45.02,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小貓輕咬般你儂我儂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:50.06,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}這麼直到永遠就好了
